Why the app works:

Because the agent transform the underlying biochemical logic into code and scripts effectively. After I offered idea , the agent turned it into reality by coding.

Why the app doesn't work perfectlly:

Because there exist information gap between me and the agent. I can't diagnose the mistakes of the code, and the agent sometimes generate wrong results because my prompt has errors or omissions. So the final result is a bit different from what I imagined.

What I have learnt:

Agentic AI is a strong tool. However, cooperation between human and agent is still important which determines the accuracy and the quality of the result.
